WEBVTT

00:00:00.145 --> 00:00:04.270
“Auto Reel” offers another way to start. Set the target duration, pacing and analysis precision.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:08.599
“Automatic duration” lets the app choose the length. Lower precision analyzes fewer samples.

00:00:08.599 --> 00:00:15.718
Select “Create reel” to analyze the media on this device. The waiting time is shortened in this video.

00:00:15.718 --> 00:00:29.493
Review the generated parts and play the draft before exporting.
